{
 "en": [
  {
   "text": "Ever catch yourself nodding while your brain’s already elsewhere?",
   "start": 0.63,
   "end": 3.582,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    106,
    200,
    974,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You’re in a stand‑up, eyes on the screen, but your thoughts wander.",
   "start": 4.06,
   "end": 7.607,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    65,
    200,
    1015,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That drift means you miss key updates and waste the whole team’s time.",
   "start": 8.426,
   "end": 11.962,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    60,
    200,
    1019,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Our minds treat a brief pause as a cue to switch modes,",
   "start": 12.44,
   "end": 15.428,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    67,
    200,
    1013,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "especially with chat‑AI suggestions popping up.",
   "start": 15.666,
   "end": 18.237,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    158,
    200,
    922,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The brain fills the gap with imagined replies,",
   "start": 19.056,
   "end": 21.354,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    105,
    200,
    975,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "so you think you’re listening when you’re not.",
   "start": 21.592,
   "end": 23.247,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    92,
    200,
    987,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Recognizing that gap—realizing you’re drafting a reply",
   "start": 24.068,
   "end": 27.187,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    65,
    200,
    1014,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "instead of hearing—creates a metacognitive checkpoint.",
   "start": 27.199,
   "end": 30.104,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    91,
    200,
    988,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Imagine you see an AI‑generated agenda suggestion and",
   "start": 30.61,
   "end": 33.681,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    210,
    200,
    870,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "start typing before the speaker finishes.",
   "start": 33.693,
   "end": 35.812,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    180,
    200,
    900,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "By the time they finish, you’ve already missed the next task assignment.",
   "start": 36.631,
   "end": 40.119,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    59,
    200,
    1021,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "When you notice the urge to type, pause the draft and say “hold on”.",
   "start": 40.61,
   "end": 44.312,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    73,
    200,
    1006,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Count silently to three, then refocus on the speaker’s voice.",
   "start": 45.131,
   "end": 48.643,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    94,
    200,
    986,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "After the stand‑up, jot a quick note of what you missed and why.",
   "start": 49.464,
   "end": 52.714,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    139,
    200,
    941,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Repeat this pause‑and‑reflect loop for each meeting to train your attention muscle.",
   "start": 53.548,
   "end": 57.441,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    56,
    200,
    1023,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this reel so you can revisit the tip.",
   "start": 57.899,
   "end": 60.11,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    133,
    200,
    947,
    356
   ]
  }
 ],
